    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a casual, 3D game with sail ship battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is a world map showing the position of some enemy ships, and the position of your own ship (with the points of the compass).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can use a compass and a world map to determine the way you reach the (displayed) enemy ships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world map will only show you the position of your ship and your opponents, if it is prompted by pressing a key. You have a limited number of queries, which is reduced for each query, but you get new ones by defeating enemy ships. Worth to count this for good navigation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">17 enemy ship type in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can fight with other character in a tactical duel. The characters have three types of weapons (sword, shield, bow). You can win if you attack the enemy character with the right weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can create the design of your own ship from different parts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Ship battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Navigation with compass and world map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Tactical duel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    17 enemy ship type</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Design maker</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a casual, 3D game with sail ship battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is a world map showing the position of some enemy ships, and the position of your own ship (with the points of the compass).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can use a compass and a world map to determine the way you reach the (displayed) enemy ships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world map will only show you the position of your ship and your opponents, if it is prompted by pressing a key. You have a limited number of queries, which is reduced for each query, but you get new ones by defeating enemy ships. Worth to count this for good navigation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">17 enemy ship type in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can fight with other character in a tactical duel. The characters have three types of weapons (sword, shield, bow). You can win if you attack the enemy character with the right weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can create the design of your own ship from different parts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Ship battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Navigation with compass and world map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Tactical duel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    17 enemy ship type</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Design maker</p></li></ul>",
